  "description": "There’s no laws when it comes to love. Attorney-at-law Theo Ju is haunted by the disappearance of his ex-lover, who disappeared without a trace while in possession of important evidence. Compounding his despair, the purchase of his long-desired Green House falls through, leading Theo to try and blow off steam via a one night stand with Dylan Lowell: a famous a-list actor he runs into by chance one day. But Theo is soon to learn that what once seemed to be a serendipitous encounter may instead lead to a winding path of regret… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
